body: "## Scope\\n\\nDeliver one production-ready API and release reliability bundle: typed compact registry discovery with optional semantic decoding and filters, complete docs/help/schema/live acceptance, latest managed pm-changelog, and clean-runner publication verification parity. Raw live inventories and credentials remain external and redacted."
